WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.857
Greater than ALL is stricter The outer age must be
greater than every age

00:00:05.870 --> 00:00:11.526
returned by the inner query A useful intuition is to
compare with

00:00:11.552 --> 00:00:17.328
the maximum To be greater than all returned ages the
outer value must

00:00:17.354 --> 00:00:23.133
exceed the largest one Run the query and compare the
row count with the ANY

00:00:23.159 --> 00:00:23.830
example
